## 10. Personalized recruiter emails

I want actual emails sent, not just generic drafts.

After a successful job application:

1. Find the most relevant recruiter or hiring manager.
2. Verify their professional email.
3. Write a short, personalized email.
4. Mention the exact position and company.
5. Mention that I have applied.
6. Include 2–3 lines about my relevant experience and projects.
7. Attach the exact tailored resume submitted with the application.
8. Send through my connected Gmail account.
9. Record the email and status.

Do not send outreach for unsuccessful or incomplete applications.

Do not send duplicate emails to the same person for the same role.

Do not send emails to guessed, unverified or risky addresses.

I authorize automatic personalized recruiter outreach under these rules, subject to the daily limit.

## 11. Daily limits

